{"id":"631820","name":"大黄米蜜枣粽","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631820/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大黄米","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大黄米。","img":"images/631820/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"洗净浸泡几小时。","img":"images/631820/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"五寸的蛋糕模铺粽子叶放大黄米。","img":"images/631820/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放蜜枣。","img":"images/631820/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放米。","img":"images/631820/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"包起来。","img":"images/631820/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上盖子。","img":"images/631820/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅里放纯净水，放粽子。","img":"images/631820/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖锅盖，大火烧开。","img":"images/631820/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"改中小火煮40分钟，焖一小时即可。","img":"images/631820/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"焖了一小时的粽子，拿掉盖子。","img":"images/631820/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"取出来。","img":"images/631820/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"打开。","img":"images/631820/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631820/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"我把粽叶当调味品了哈，没有粽叶的香味，就不是粽子了。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}